      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.32,
      "end_seconds": 369.31,
      "duration_seconds": 19.99,
      "text": "the treatment will be beclometasone and formoterol 100 and 6 micrograms two puffs twice a day long term. It's for asthma control. Use the spacer and rinse your mouth after the preventer. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse"
    },
